  ["Canadian toothpaste amount: under 3 and 3 to 6","Under 3: adult brushes, rice-grain only if at risk, otherwise water. 3-6: pea-sized with adult help"],
  ["Professional topical fluoride under age 6","5% sodium fluoride varnish"],
  ["SDF concentration and action","38%; silver is antibacterial, fluoride hardens and arrests the lesion"],
  ["Key item in SDF consent","Permanent black staining of treated lesions; temporary skin, gum and clothing stains; possible need for reapplication"],
  ["SDF contraindications","Silver allergy, ulcerative gingivitis or stomatitis, tooth with signs of pulpitis or necrosis"]
